    ["Which year's Constitution allowed Kenyans to be dual citizens?", "2010", [["1963", "M_CZ_ONE_PASSPORT"], ["1990", "M_CZ_ONE_PASSPORT"], ["2001", "M_CZ_ONE_PASSPORT"]], "The 2010 Constitution introduced dual citizenship."]
